  "body": "The [authority state](https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#authority-state) mentions that username and password should be encoded with the default encode set.\n\nThe \"set the username\" and \"set the password\" steps [further down](https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#set-the-username) (which are referenced by the attribute setters) mention the specific encode sets dedicated to encoding username and password.\n\nIs it expected that an implementation only appends to a temporary user/pw buffer and then calls set the user / set the password seperately, or is this a bug in the spec?\n",
